<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">GALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa AkwaGalata</para>
  <para style="toc2">AkwaGalata</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaGalatia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Yame no Paulu, kanganda ka Yesu Krisitu, kadi keshima yanu nji ku tuminiwa kwa munu, unone keshima ya Yesu Krisitu na Nyambi Tata, oyu wa pindurire Yesu kwafu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Akwakutawa wahe awa a di nange kuno, name kengeyo twaa mi vumenena amwe mwa makereke o mu Galatia ci:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Thsihemo no thsiyaro ikare nenu ku tunderera kwa Nyambi Tata wetu noku kwa Fumu Yesu Krisitu, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />oyu wa shuvire mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kevi yetu ci a tu rukurure ku kaye kokamango ko rerodino. Wa tendire kengeyo keshima ya Nyambi Tata wetu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Kutethzima kwikare kwa Nyambi diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Evangeli po thzofoci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ni na komoka nene ci mu na thsii wanguwangu Nyambi oyu na a mithsi ko thsihemo thsa Krisitu, no ku shupwera muthzimbu wao. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Kadi cingwa ci ko u di Muthzimbu Ouwa umweya, unone kwa di anu amweya awa a mi pambanithsa, karo aa ereka ku tengurura Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Uno honi, munu yomuhe oyu wa ku honga muthzimbu wao ku thsia ou na tu mi hongo a ku kutiwe, ikare yumweya ku kwetu nji kangeru ku tunda ku wiru. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Eci dyodiya tu na amba kare, naa mi ambera karo ci, ngeci munu ayepo mi honga muthzimbu wao o ku cithsia nou na mu tambura, oyo munu a kutiwe.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ene eyi ne naa i tendera ci a ni shangare anu nji, nji Nyambi? Inji ci naa ereka ku roerithsa anu? Nga ko ku fota ni fota ku roerithsa anu nga ka ni di mupika Krisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edi ethsiwire Paulu kwikara kanganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Andengenu, naa fota ci mu dimuke ci Muthzimbu Ouwa ou na hongire po kadi cingwa waa tunda kwanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Inene ka na ni u tambura kwa munu nji ku u ni rongithsa, unone naa u tambura ko ku u hokweriwa ku tunda kwa Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Inene na mu yuvu edi na yoyire o ku ni shupwera thsitawo thso Thsijuda, nedi na ooterire ku nyandithsa nene kereke thza Nyambi ku ereka ku thzi hanyahanya. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mu thsitawo thso Thsijuda na pitire anu owangi o taka thzange mu kaci kaenthzange Majuda, karo na shimine nene erongithsa yo thsithsemwa yakwathsañuruetu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Unone Nyambi wa ni tororire o ku ni shime kwerekiwa ci ni mu kwamene. Na a nithsi ko thsihemo thsenthzi ci nikare mupikenthzi. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Aye na i mu roerithsa ku hokora Mwane ku kwange ci ni ka honge Muthzimbu Ouwa keyi yenthzi kwAnukenge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:16">Uno honi ka na cirerire ku kepura munu. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Ka na kambamine ku thza ku Yerusalema ci ni ka cimone nowa ekarire tunganda ame o ku ni shime kwikara kanganda, unone na thzire ku ditunga dya Arabia, ngou honi na hukire ku Damaseka.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Munyima thzo myaka thzihatu, na thzire ku Yerusalema ku ka cidimuka na Peturu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kefasi.</char></note>, na kekarire nenthzi mathsunda edi. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Unone ka na ka cimonine no kanganda kamweya shime Jakovo mina Fumu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Eyi ni mi ñorera po yashemwa. Naa tanarithsa pa meho a Nyambi ci ka ni mi tongwerire yokwithsa.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ngou na thzire mu matunga a Siria na Silisia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Kethsiya thsikati akwakutawa o makereke a Krisitu aa a di mu Judea ka ni dimukire thsihanga. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Shime a yuvangire pohuma kwanu ci: “Oyu naa tu nyandithsanga yodiyo oyu honga honi yo thsitawo ethsi a erekire ku hanyahanya.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ngou a shangarire Nyambi mukaci kange.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa tamburiwa ku tunganda tumweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Munyima thzo myaka thzo dikumi na thzine, na hukire karo ku Yerusalema na Banabasi. Na shimbire no Tite. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Na thzireko, inene Nyambi shime a ni monithsire ci naa roera ku tenda kengeyo. Ou twa ciwanenine ku mukunda nowa a remekiwire ci aendithsi, na wa tongawerire Muthzimbu Ouwa ou na hongire kwAnukenge. Ka na fotire ci ekwama yange yo kutanga, neyi yo pano tu di ci ikare yo mbango. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Uno honi shaanga Tite oyu nekarire nenthzi, ka a ooteriwire ku thza ku mukanda shaanga ci aye po Mugerike.<verse eid="GAL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Anu amweya awa a cimonaharithsire eci akwakutawa a na ciwanine netu. Awa anu shime a keyire ku na nenga ci a mone kurukuruka oku tu di nako mwa Krisitu Yesu, ci a tu tware mupika. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ka twa cihuthsire kushi kukwo shaanga thsikati thsothsipu, shime twa tendire kengeyo ci tu twethse ku mi turekera oshemwa o Muthzimbu Ouwa.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Eciko awa a monaharire ci akuru mu thsivaka po kwithsa ethsi thsa ni korithsire ku mucima mukaciko, inene Nyambi ka a wana mavwevwe, awopo kwithsa ethsi a vungithsire ku maywi ange. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Mane awo a monine ci Nyambi na a ni pa ekwama yo ku rongithsa Muthzimbu Ouwa kwAnukenge eci edi a piwire Peturu ekwama yo ku rongithsa Muthzimbu Ouwa ku Majuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Inene Nyambi oyu wa kwamithsire Peturu kwikara kanganda ku Majuda, yowa ni kwamithsire name kwikara kanganda kwAnukenge.<verse eid="GAL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Jakovo, Peturu na Johani, awa a shimbiwire ci wodiyo maunthzi o kereke, a monine ci Nyambi na a ni pa ethsi thsipa. A tamburire ko moko edi Banabasi name kwikara aenthzo mwikwama. Ngou twa ciyuvire ci atwe tu ka kwamene kwAnukenge, awo a kwamene ku Majuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Eyi a tu rombire pohuma po ku vurukanga ahepwe, eyi po yo na fotangire nene ku tenda ku tunda ku matatekero.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa shomorora Peturu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Peturu ou a na kumine mu Antioke, na mu kanenine shemwa thsitonwameho, inene shime epithsire. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Inene anu awa a tumine Jakovo o kwa shime ku na kuma, Peturu shime a dyangire nAnukenge. Unone awo anu ou a kumine, aye wa hukire munyima no kukana ku dya nAnukenge, pa ku yapa aenthzenthzi akwa thsipani thso mukanda. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />No Majuda amweya nawo ekarire no mahetaheta eci Peturu. Mane mahetaheta o a retithserire Banabasi ku pambana.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ou na monine ci eyi a tendire ka ya endererire noshemwa o Muthzimbu Ouwa, na amberire Peturu pa meho o wahe ci: “Owe po o Mujuda, unone waa yoya eci Munukenge kadi eci Mujuda. Ine honi eyi o ooterera Anukenge ci a yoye eci Majuda?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Majuda nAnukenge aa yoyithsiwa ko thsitawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Atwe po twa Majuda ko kwerekiwa, kadi twanu wevi eci Anukenge. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Uno honi, tu na dimuka ci munu ka a tendiwire o muwawa ketenda yo murao, unone ko thsitawo kwa Krisitu Yesu. Mweyo, natwe na tu tawa kwa Yesu Krisitu ci nga tu tendiwe owawawa ko thsitawo kwa Yesu Krisitu kadi ketenda yo murao, inene ketenda yo murao kwithsa oyu nga tendiwa omuwawa.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Uno honi ngeci twaa fota ku tendiwa owawawa ko thsitawo kwa Krisitu, natwe twa Majuda twaa waniwa ci twanu wevi. Ene eyi ne yaa monithsa ci Krisitu po ngamba thsivi nji? Dyombo! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ngeci naa umba karo eyi na ni umburura, apo honi naa cora murao. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Inene ou na erekire ku hengeka murao, murao wa ni raturire. Mweyo, na ni fu ku murao ci ni twethse ku yoyera Nyambi. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Na niambiwa pa mbinda na Krisitu, kadi yame ni yoya, unone Krisitu oyu yoya mu mwange. Ou mwoyo ni yoya pano honi mwirama po naa u yoya ko thsitawo kwa Mwana Nyambi oyu wa ni shimine no ku shuva mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kange. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Ka ni kanine thsihemo thsa Nyambi, inene ngeci munu aa tendiwa omuwawa ketenda yo murao, apo honi po yaa monithsa ci Krisitu kwithsa eyi a fererire.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC. CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Murao no thsitawo kwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Amwe mwakwa Galatia o kupira maano! Edye oyu na a mi roo? Ya monithsiwire nawanawa pa meho enu ci Yesu Krisitu wambiwire pa mbinda! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Naa fota ku mipura thsinu thsofoci pohuma: Ene shime mwa tamburire Mupepo wa Nyambi ketenda yo murao nji ko ku tawa Muthzimbu Ouwa? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ene mwa tomba nji? Na mu tateka ko Mupepo, ene mwaa fota honi ku manenena kokoro wenu nji? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ene shime na mu piti mu makando mwinu yoingi mukenge nji? Yoshemwa ya mi kwathsire thsimweya. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ene Nyambi oyu na a mi pa Mupepo wenthzi no ku tenda ekomokithsa mu kaci kenu ne shime naa tende kengeyo ketenda yo murao nji ko ku tawa kwenu Muthzimbu Ouwa?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Eci edi i na ambiwa mu Mañoro keyi ya Aburahama ci: “Wa tawire kwa Nyambi, karo Nyambi wa mu varire kwikara omuwawa mukaci ko thsitawo thsenthzi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Mweyo, mu dimuke ci awa a di no thsitawo wodiyo pohuma ethsiwa ci ana Aburahama. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Mañoro ko ku mona yo ku rupara ci Nyambi kenge mba a tenda Anukenge kwikara owawawa ko thsitawo, Nyambi wa hongire cimo Muthzimbu Ouwa kwa Aburahama ou a ambire ci: “Matunga oahe kenge mba a fiyaweriwa mukaci koe.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Mweyo, awa a na tawa aa fiyaweriwa pofoci na Aburahama aye mukwerume o thsitawo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Wahe awa a na kurupera etenda yo murao mushi thzo thsikuto a di, inene ku na ñoriwa ci: “Ku kutiwe munu yomuhe o kukana ku twarerera ku tenda yoihe eyi i na ñoriwa mu vuka thzo murao.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Apa honi yaa monahara nawa ci kwithsa o kwikara o muwawa pa meho a Nyambi ketenda yo murao, inene ku na ñoriwa ci: “O muwawa kenge a ku yoya ko thsitawo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Murao ka u tanarerire pa thsitawo, unone wa amba ci: “Munu yomuhe o ku tenda eyi enu kenge a ku yoya kayo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Unone Krisitu wa tu paturire ku thsikuto thso murao ko ku citenda o thsikuto mukaci ketu, inene ku na ñoriwa ci: “Ku kutiwe munu yomuhe o ku kurekiwa pa thsitondo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Wa tu paturire ci thsiyauthzi thsa Aburahama nga thsi keye kwAnukenge ka Krisitu Yesu, ci ko thsitawo nga tu twethse ku tambura thsikumbwethzo thso Mupepo.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murao no thsikumbwethzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Andengenu, ni mi monithse muro kenu eyi i tendahara diyuwa no diyuwa. Ngeci anu aa ciyuva thsinu, aa tanarithsa ethso thsiyuvano, kwithsa o ku kana eyi a na ciyuvu nji ku vungithsako thsimweya. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Mofoci no Nyambi edi a kumbwethzire Aburahama na mwanahoka wenthzi. Mañoro ka a ambire ci: “Nanahoka oe,” ku monithsa ci anu owangi, unone aa amba ci: “Na mwanahoka woe,” ku monithsa ci munu yofoci, aye Krisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Eyi ni amba po naa amba ci: Nyambi shime a tangire ku cikwata thsiyuvano na Aburahama no ku thsi hengeka, ao murao mbeci u keye munyima thzo myaka thzo 430. Tumba u twethsa ku mana ethso thsiyuvano nji kwipithsa thsikumbwethzo thsa Nyambi. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Unone ngeci twaa tambura thsiyauthzi thsa Nyambi ko murao, apo honi ka tu thsi tamburire ko thsikumbwethzo, uno honi Nyambi ko thsihemo thsenthzi wa thsi pire Aburahama ko thsikumbwethzo.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Murao honi ne ine wa piwerire? Shime wa piwire mukaci ko murandu wetu shime aye mwanahoka oyu wa kumbwethziwire ou a keyire. Murao po shime wa piwire ko tungeru, mukwa ku twimanena mbeci a u tu tambwere. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Mukwakwimanena po tumba a fotiwa ngeci munu yofoci pohuma diko, unone Nyambi po yofoci.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ene eyi ne yaa monithsa ci murao waa rwithsa ekumbwethzo ya Nyambi nji? Dyombo! Inene murao nga wa piwire ci u pe mwoyo, apo honi owawa nga na u keya ko murao. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Unone Mañoro aa amba ci kaye kokahe mukoro o thsivi ka di, ci eyi ya kumbwethziwire eyi i piwa ko thsitawo kwa Yesu Krisitu nga i piwe kowa a tawa.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Uno honi thsitawo o ku thsi shime ku keya, murao shime wa twangire eci enthzinda shime thsitawo ethsi thsa roerire ku keya mu kaye ou thsa hokoriwire. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Mweyo, murao wa tu nyungire shime Krisitu ou a kumine ci tu twethse kwikara owawawa ko thsitawo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Uno honi na thsi keye ethsi thsitawo, ka tu di honi mushi thza mukwakunyunga.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Inene kwa Krisitu Yesu mwahe mwana Nyambi ko thsitawo. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Inene mwahe amwe na mu korovethziwa mwa Krisitu, na mu vata Krisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Mweyo, kwithsa thsiano mu kaci ko Majuda nAnukenge, mu kaci kapika nakwakurukuruka, mu kaci kakwerume nambuyama. Inene mwahe mwa thsofoci mwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Pano honi mu nekara anua Krisitu, mwanahoka a Aburahama, karo mwashwana weyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Eyi ni amba po eyi, shwana o ku di wanuke aa cishoka no mupika, shaanga ikare ci enu yoihe yenthzi. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Uno honi o ku di wanuke, mushi thzowa a na mu nyungu nowa a na mu monena yenthzi a di shime ku ka kuma mu thsikati ethsi a hangurire Tata wenthzi. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Mofoci, natwe ou twekarire wanuke shime twa pikuriwire kukoro o mipepo thzo kaye.<verse eid="GAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Uno honi thsikati ethsi thsi na roera ou thsa kumine, Nyambi wa tumine Mwane, oyu werekiwire kwa mbuyama no ku yoya mushi thzo murao. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Nyambi wa mu tumine ku na patura awa ekarire mushi thzo murao o Thsijuda, ci nga twañuriwe kwikara ana Nyambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mukaci ko kwikara anenthzi, Nyambi naa tu tumena Mupepo wa Mwane mu micima thzetu, ou u kumba ci: “Aba, Tata!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Mweyo, ko di honi mupika, unone o mwanenthzi, karo pakuninga ci o mwanenthzi, Nyambi na a ku tende shwana.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu yaa mu korithsa ku mucima yAkwaGalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kare o ku mu shime ku dimuka Nyambi, mwa pikuriwire kwinu eyi i di ci kadi anyambi shemwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Uno honi na mu dimuka Nyambi, nji ni ambe ci uno naa mi dimuka Nyambi ne, ine honi eyi mu hukera kweyi yo ku faratera karo i shikwathsa thsimweya yokoro o mipepo thzo kaye? Ine eyi mu fotera kwikara apika ku kwayo karo? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mwaa mamera yo mayuwa, yo maonda, yekati neyi yo myaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Naa yapa keyi yenu, ci ngwa ekwama eyi na ni kwama mu mwenu ya kenge.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Andengenu, naa mi adikanena, mwikare eci ame, inene name ni nekara eci amwe. Kwithsa ethsi na mu nipithsera. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Mu na dimuka ci uya na mi hongire Muthzimbu Ouwa pa kutanga po nedi mukaci kekora yerama. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Shaanga ci ekora yange yerama yekarire iereka ku kwenu, ka mwa ni nyengwire nji ku ni kana, unone mwa ni tamburire eci kangeru ka Nyambi, nji eci no Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Thsiya thsinyanyu thsenu ne kupi thsi di honi? Naa twethsa ku pa ombangi ci nga shime ya tawire, nga mwa thzongorire meho enu no ku a ni pa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ene ni nekara honi mukwathsithzimbo thsenu pa ku mi tongwera oshemwa nji?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Awo anu amweya aa mi monithsa thsihemo ci nga mu shime awo, unone eanekera yo kadi iwa. Eyi a fota pohuma awo po ku mi pandura ku kwange ci mu were kukwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ngeci munu aa takamithsa ku tenda enu yoiwa, eyo po i di nawa, unone aa roera ku tendanga kengeyo thsikati thsothsihe, kadi o ku ni di pohuma nenu.<verse eid="GAL 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Anange awa na shima, naa yuva karo ku kora mukaci kenu eci mbuyama oyu nyatithsa, karo kenge ya kwikara kengeyo shime ku ka kuma apa mwa kwikarera eci Krisitu ko kuyara. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Kadi edi ni na cikumbwethza ci nga ni di nenu pano no ku cinja diywi dyange, inene ni na karupera nene mukaci kenu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagare na Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Mu ni tongwere amwe mu fota kwikara mushi thzo murao, ene ka mu yuvithsithsire eyi u na amba murao nji? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Inene ku na ñoriwa ci Aburahama wekarire nana aidi wakwerume, yumweya kwa mbuyama o mupika, yumweya kwa mbuyama o kurukuruka. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Uno honi mwanenthzi koya mbuyama o mupika werekiwire kekwama yerama, koya o kurukuruka aye werekiwire ko thsikumbwethzo.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Eyi kenge nga tu i shimba ci yaemanena enu. Awa ambuyama po eyuvano idi. Hagare aemanena thsiyuvano thso pa Mukinya wa Sinai. Ethso thsiyuvano thsaereka ana wapika. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hagare aemanena Mukinya wa Sinai mu Arabia, karo a enderera no thsikuña thsa Yerusalema o rerodino, inene mupika a di nanenthzi. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Uno honi Yerusalema o ku wiru po wa kurukuruka, karo yodiyo mama wetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Inene ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“O roere owe o mbuyama o mvumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">owe wa kana kwereka mwana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">O humwerere no ku kumba ko thsinyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">owe wa kana ku nyatithsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Inene mbuyama oyu wa kaniwire o di nana owangi honi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kupita mbuyama oyu di na munuwenthzi.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Andengenu, amwe honi po mwana o thsikumbwethzo eci edi ekarire Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Uno honi kethsiya thsikati, mwana oyu werekiwire kekwama yerama wa nyandithsire oyu werekiwire kokoro o Mupepo. Dyo i di no rero. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Uno honi Mañoro ne aa amba ine? Aa amba ci: “O cithze mbuyama o mupika na mwanenthzi, inene mwana mupika mbera ka a shwana na mwana o mbuyama o kurukuruka.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Mweyo, andengenu, kadi twana mbuyama o mupika, unone twana mbuyama o kurukuruka.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kurukuruka mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Krisitu na a tu rukurura ci twikare o kurukuruka shemwa. Mweyo, mu tanare karo mwa tawa ci mu hukere kwangiwa kupika o murao karo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Mu teerere! Ame no Paulu naa mi ambera ci ngeci mwaa tawa yo mukanda, apo honi Krisitu ka a kwathsire thsimweya ku kwenu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Naa hukera karo ku amba ci munu yomuhe o ku tambura mukanda nangiwa ku shupwera murao wa Mushe ouhe. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Amwe mu fota ku citenda mwathsinda owawawa pa meho a Nyambi ko ku shupwera murao wa Mushe, mu na tetiwa kwa Krisitu. Mu na tundu ku thsihemo thsa Nyambi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Inene ko Mupepo, twaa taterera nene ko thsitawo okurupero o ku ninga ci Nyambi kenge a ku tu tenda owawawa. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Inene mwa Krisitu Yesu, ku thza ku mukanda nji kukana ku thza ku mukanda ka i kwathsire thsimweya. Thsothsikuru mu thsivaka po kwikara no thsitawo ethsi thsi kwama ko thsishimo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Shime mwaa tateka nawa. Edye oyu na a mi kwangithsa ku shupwera oshemwa? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kadi cingwa Nyambi oyu na a mithsi, oyu na a mi tende kengeyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />“Mamene oapu aa tundurukithsa dikende dyodihe.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Naa kurupera shemwa mwa Fumu ci ka mwa ku tawa yayo. Oyu mi pambanithsa, ikare edye nji edye, Nyambi kenge a ku mu ratura. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Andengenu, ngeci ame ko ku honga ni honga yo mukanda ne, ine honi eyi ni nyandithsiwera? Nga dyo i di kengeyo po mbinda nga ka thzipithserire munu. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Naa cikumbwethza ci awo anu a reta mikwangarakanyi mu kaci kenu nga aa cifaura athsinda.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Eciko amwe, andengenu, shime mwethsiwire ci mwikare o kurukuruka. Uno honi mwa cikwathsithsa oko kurukuruka kwenu kwingena mwicikumbwethza yerama, unone mu cikwamene oandu mu thsishimo. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Inene murao ouhe u na cipundeka mu thsiraerera thsofoci thso ku amba ci: “O shime muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Uno honi ngeci mwaa cihumaura no ku cipapaura eci ekondwama, mu mamere ci kenge mwa ku cithzirithsa mwathsinda.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu endithsiwe ku Mupepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Mweyo, naa amba ci, mu thsie Mupepo u endithse myoyo thzenu. Apo honi ka mu tendanga ayo ecikumbwethza yerama. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Inene ecikumbwethza yerama yaa rwithsa yo Mupepo, karo yo Mupepo yaa rwithsa yerama. Eyo idi yaa cirwithsa ci mu kwange ku tenda eyi mu na foto ku tenda. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Unone ngeci mwaa endithsiwa ku Mupepo, ka mu di mushi thzo murao.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ekwama yerama i na dimukiwa: ruthziho, yodithziro, ongurunde, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ku rombera ekupuro, orothzi, ethzimbo, dikanyi, mbamba, oanthzi nene, oñondi, mikwangarakanyi, kucitepatepa, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />thsipururu, otakwa, mashambirera o kaye, nevi imweya yo ku cipitura eci eyi. Naa mi nomenithsa eci diya na ni mi nomenithsa pa kutanga ci yomuhe oyu na yoyo mwoyo o kengeyo ka a ku tambura Kutumina kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Uno honi thsima thso Mupepo po: thsishimo, thsinyanyu, thsiyaro, kukwatamucima, thsihemo, owa, orurami, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />kuwamucima, kucinyunga. Kwithsa murao ou u na kanithsa eyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Awa a di kwa Krisitu Yesu nepaa ecikumbwethza nefota yerama. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ngeci twaa yoya ko Mupepo, tu twarererenu ku enda ko Mupepo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Twa cinuneka, nji ku cianthzipithsa mu kaci ketu, nji ku citendera thsipururu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mu cishimbithse oandu mipango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Andengenu, ngeci munu yumweya ayepo waniwa o ku tenda thsivi, amwe mu di no Mupepo wa Nyambi mwaa roera ku huthsera oya munu mu dikuñwa dyowawa ko kuwamucima. Uno honi mu mamere ci katere mu tumauriwe namwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mu cishimbithse oandu mipango, ko ku tenda kengeyo mwaa yarithserera murao wa Krisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Inene ngeci yumweya aa cishimba ci mukuru mu thsivaka, aye o ku di thsikura pohuma, aa ciangera yothsinda. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Munu no munu a tatufe etenda yenthzi mbeci nga a cinuneke ko kukana ku cishokithsa na muenthzenthzi. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Inene munu no munu aa roera ku shimba mupango wenthzi.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Oyu rongithsiwa diywi dya Nyambi aa roera ku ciera yoihe yoiwa na murongithsi wenthzi.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Mwangeriwa, Nyambi tumba a varaeriwa, inene yoihe eyi a kuna munu yodiyo a ku cora. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Yomuhe o ku kuna ku roerithsa erama yenthzi, kenge a ku wana dicora dyo ku nongithsiwa, unone o ku kuna ku roerithsa Mupepo, kenge a ku wana dicora dyo mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Twa aya ku tenda yoiwa, inene ko thsikati ethsi thsi na roera kenge twa ku wana dicora dyodiwawa ngeci atwepo tu kana ku huka munyima. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Mweyo, uno tu di no thsikati, tu tende yoiwa kwa munu yomuhe, thsikurupo akwa mwanda ofoci netu mu thsitawo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eraerera yo mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Mu mone okuru o mataku aa ni cikwathsithsa ku mi ñorera ko dyoko dyange.<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Awa a fota ku roerithsa anu kerama, wodiyo awa mi ootera ci mu thze ku mukanda. Eyi a i tendera eyo po ku yapa ci katere a nyandithsiwe mukaci ko mbinda thza Krisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Inene shaanga akwamukanda ka shupwerire murao, unone aa fota ci amwe mu thze ku mukanda ci a cishangarere peyi i na kwamiwa perama yenu.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Mbera na cishangarera yayo, shime yo mbinda thza Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. Inene ko mbinda, kaye na ka fu ku kwange, name na ni fu ku kaye. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Inene munu shaanga yoyu thza nji ka a thzire ku mukanda, eyo ka i kwathsire thsimweya. Thsothsikuru po munu kwikara thsumbiwa thsothsipe. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Kowa wahe awa a na shupwera ou murao mu myoyo thzo, naa amba ci: “Thsiyaro no ñeke ikareno, ikare na Isiraele wa Nyambi.”<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ko ku manenena, ka ni fotire karo ci munu a ku ni cakanithse, inene ni di netwa perama yange eyi i monithsa ci no mupika Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu thsikare no mupepo wenu mwaenthzange. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>